{
  "$meta": {
    "source": "Figma 'UI Kit' (SysGears website). All values in px unless noted.",
    "status": "doc = written down as a rule in Figma; obs = seen consistently in components but not stated as a rule. See README for open questions.",
    "units": "Text sizes and every spacing value (section, gap, inset, stack, component padding and gaps) are in rem with 1rem = 16px, so they scale with the root font size. Structural limits stay in px: container, side margin, breakpoints, min/max widths, borders, radii, icon and image dimensions. Line-heights are unitless."
  },
